  "off": 47,
  "len": 14,
  "en": "Touya: It's open.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 49,
  "text_len": 11
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:00052",
  "jp": "セリカ「‥‥」",
  "off": 82,
  "len": 12,
  "en": "Celica: ...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 84,
  "text_len": 9
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:00061",
  "jp": "トウヤ「どうした？」",
  "off": 97,
  "len": 14,
  "en": "Touya: What's wrong?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 99,
  "text_len": 11
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:00072",
  "jp": "セリカ「うん‥‥ねえ、私も一緒に連れていってくれない？」",
  "off": 114,
  "len": 38,
  "en": "Celica: Okay... Hey, won't you take me with you?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 116,
  "text_len": 35
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:0009B",
  "jp": "トウヤ「それはマズイだろ。いくら辺境の村とはいえ、{nl}　セリカの顔ぐらいは知ってるだろ？」",
  "off": 155,
  "len": 53,
  "en": "Touya: That's a bad idea. Even if it's some backwater village, they'll at least know Celica's face, won't they?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 157,
  "text_len": 50
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:000D3",
  "jp": "セリカ「そうだけど‥‥」",
  "off": 211,
  "len": 17,
  "en": "Celica: That's true, but...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 213,
  "text_len": 14
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:000E7",
  "jp": "トウヤ「心配なのはわかるが、救出作戦の概要が{nl}　決まるまでは俺達に任せろって」",
  "off": 231,
  "len": 54,
  "en": "Touya: I know you're worried, but leave it to us until the rescue plan's been worked out.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 233,
  "text_len": 51
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:00120",
  "jp": "セリカ「でも‥‥」",
  "off": 288,
  "len": 14,
  "en": "Celica: But...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 290,
  "text_len": 11
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:00131",
  "jp": "トウヤ「心配するな。救出の時はかならずセリカも一緒に{nl}　行けるようにするから」",
  "off": 305,
  "len": 50,
  "en": "Touya: Don't worry. When it's time for the rescue, I'll make sure Celica comes along too.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 307,
  "text_len": 47
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:0016C",
  "jp": "セリカ「本当？」",
  "off": 364,
  "len": 14,
  "en": "Celica: Really?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 366,
  "text_len": 11
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:0017D",
  "jp": "トウヤ「ああ、約束だ。みんなが反対しても俺はお前の{nl}　味方でいるよ」",
  "off": 381,
  "len": 45,
  "en": "Touya: Yeah, it's a promise. Even if everyone's against it, I'll be on your side.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 383,
  "text_len": 42
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:001B3",
  "jp": "セリカ「‥‥うん、わかった。トウヤを信じるよ」",
  "off": 435,
  "len": 29,
  "en": "Celica: ...Okay, got it. I'll trust you, Touya.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 437,
  "text_len": 26
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:001D3",
  "jp": "トウヤ「ああ、任せとけ」",
  "off": 467,
  "len": 16,
  "en": "Touya: Yeah, leave it to me.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 469,
  "text_len": 13
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:001E6",
  "jp": "セリカ「ふふふ、わがまま言ってごめんね。{nl}　そ、それじゃ」",
  "off": 486,
  "len": 33,
  "en": "Celica: Hehe, sorry for being selfish. W-well, see ya.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 488,
  "text_len": 30
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:00216",
  "jp": "ヤマト（意外とあっさりニャっ得したわね。{nl}　これも愛のニャせるワザかニャ？）",
  "off": 534,
  "len": 46,
  "en": "Yamato: (She came around surprisingly easily. Is this love working its magic, nya?)",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 536,
  "text_len": 43
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:00247",
  "jp": "トウヤ「ん？　なんか言ったか？」",
  "off": 583,
  "len": 22,
  "en": "Touya: Hm? You say something?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 585,
  "text_len": 19
 },
 {
  "id": "sce423:00260",
  "jp": "ヤマト「ううん、別に！」",
  "off": 608,
  "len": 17,
  "en": "Yamato: Nope, nothing!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 610,
  "text_len": 14
 }
]
